<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women's doubles, final</p>
<p>4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat 3-Lindsay Davenport/Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Men's doubles, semifinal</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge/Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Rick Leach/Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 6-3 7-6 (7-2) 5-7 6-1  </p>
<p>Men's singles semifinal</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 5-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-1 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
</text>
